## 3. Core Architecture Decisions (Pre-filled for Zero-Risk SaaS Stack)

### ADR-001: Frontend Framework — TanStack Start

**Status**: Accepted
**Date**: [YYYY-MM-DD]
**Deciders**: [Team]

#### Context
Need a React-based full-stack framework with:
- File-based routing
- Server-side rendering (SSR) + client-side navigation
- Type-safe API layer
- Good developer experience
- Deployable to Cloudflare Pages

#### Decision
Use **TanStack Start** (v1.x) as the primary frontend framework.

#### Consequences
**Positive**:
- Built on TanStack Router (type-safe, nested routes, loaders)
- TanStack Query integrated for server state
- Vite-based, fast HMR
- Cloudflare Pages adapter available
- React Server Components (RSC) support via Vinxi
- Full-stack type safety with Zod + tRPC-style procedures

**Negative**:
- Newer ecosystem (smaller community than Next.js)
- Fewer third-party integrations
- RSC still maturing in Vinxi/TanStack Start

**Neutral**:
- Learning curve for team unfamiliar with TanStack ecosystem

#### Alternatives Considered
| Alternative | Pros | Cons | Why Not Chosen |
|-------------|------|------|----------------|
| Next.js 14+ (App Router) | Mature, huge ecosystem, RSC native | Vercel lock-in, heavier, middleware complexity on Cloudflare | Cloudflare Pages deployment friction |
| Remix v2 | Strong web standards, nested routes | Shopify ownership uncertainty, no RSC yet | TanStack Router superior type safety |
| Astro + React Islands | Great performance, multi-framework | Not a full app framework, limited SSR patterns | Need full SSR app, not content site |
| Hono + React | Lightweight, Cloudflare-native | No file routing, manual SSR setup | Higher DX cost |

#### Implementation Notes
- Use `@tanstack/start` with `@tanstack/react-router`, `@tanstack/react-query`
- Configure `vite.config.ts` with `cloudflarePages()` adapter
- Define routes in `routes/` directory with `.tsx` files
- Use `createServerFn()` for type-safe server functions (RPC style)
- Integrate with Supabase via server functions (not client-side)

#### Validation Criteria
- [ ] Cold start < 500ms on Cloudflare Pages
- [ ] TypeScript errors catch route param mismatches
- [ ] Server functions work in preview + production
- [ ] Bundle size < 200KB gzipped (initial JS)

